#: scenario7:scenario7_03113ACD_3E63_4BC9_B681_E25245B399F5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f06f82e89e5d4c51e9dc88ccc3c0eaf06f65638bc5ad48517701885d170a0c6f
#. default-sha256: 8808e1cd456892603a24f30c778d23204c6fb5cdada8b097b2369da96cb44788
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_03113ACD_3E63_4BC9_B681_E25245B399F5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Gah!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫...Ahh, ahhhh, I see, ⟪k:6⟫that’s⟪k:7⟫ what you did!⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫"
"Curses, I completely overlooked that!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Hah! Ma come—?!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫...Ahh, ho capito. ⟪k:6⟫Ecco⟪k:7⟫ cos’hai fatto!⟪k:8⟫"
"⟪k:9⟫Maledizione, non me n’ero minimamente accorto!"

#: scenario7:scenario7_804E17A2_C031_4949_9E27_D941F054CC5D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cb893c5b8388ee107ee889fd51cd1ab461f3ad043a7e0904d885ec377ddc2c92
