msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Impressive. Even I haven’t read all the books in my room.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫You planning to join "
"the order with that kind of knowledge?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Impressionante. Perfino io non ho letto tutti i libri nella mia stanza.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Non "
"avrai intenzione di unirti all’ordine con quel tipo di conoscenza?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_C2C314B5_C157_41AE_94D7_31D8286AD6DC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b8041c12a12bb86a6b5c6c4839160948e1bb768eab2a8fffabf0bcaddd5172b1
