#: scenario7:scenario7_6A53B4BE_CC02_4099_8581_D8BFEFF735B3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 76d6366e618dbebb2d011c186414b1cb35adc9e7526ea8a3d33edbea20a6f79e
