msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_6A53B4BE_CC02_4099_8581_D8BFEFF735B3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Didier! Oh Diiiidieeeer!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I’m in a bit of a bind, could— ⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
"Oh, hello there, Michelle!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Didier! Oh Diiiidieeeer!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Sono nei guai. Potresti mica— ⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Ah, "
"ciao, Michelle!"

#: scenario7:scenario7_996A59B2_B4EA_4FBB_9EF4_C81F9030A454
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 465c79e631ea552e826fe06b61330e9b6605dcd183f84ee67cfa80343cdc7fe7
