msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_98404427_389F_4D69_887E_D7799D4222A2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Just got back, yep.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Ohoho, playin’ chess again, are ya?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Lessee, what "
"do we have here?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Sono appena tornato.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Ohohoh, giocate di nuovo a scacchi, eh?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Vediamo "
"un po’...⟪k:6⟫ cos’abbiamo qui?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_8892F554_0600_4155_BDFE_A628C9B8BFC4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
