msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_7B2A7768_FBDD_4390_B6B4_666D83D299D6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫As if you’re any better!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Come se tu fossi tanto meglio!"

#: scenario7:scenario7_B0D34DBE_24A5_4A5D_8467_F8709C64AE01
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f1f7658cfbf2890bf563ef83e563a28dbbade817258ff0cca9c0f6ea39cb1414
#. default-sha256: dac27af15bf6c6b148a64bf6314ed4c8a628a812fd3924eebfa00418ff28f8a6
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_B0D34DBE_24A5_4A5D_8467_F8709C64AE01"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫That’s not funny, Georges.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I cannot approve of someone who can’t keep up with "
"the flow of battle becoming a knight."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Non c’è da scherzare, Georges.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Non posso accettare che qualcuno che non riesce "
"a stare al passo con le dinamiche della battaglia diventi un cavaliere."

#: scenario7:scenario7_38D4C3CB_2A8A_41BE_9801_699F717ECD69
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5e635f32f864eb2adbee49b5313a4b91ccf7f18d9186568e57e021ce31b6a23f
#. default-sha256: 2431f0c4005eb7c8a29e75f20053e61ef0498d805340d3bc11a2fd541427e89a
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_38D4C3CB_2A8A_41BE_9801_699F717ECD69"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Given our family’s rank, you would eventually be put in charge of other soldiers."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Considerato il rango della nostra famiglia, prima o poi verresti messo al comando di "
"altri soldati."

#: scenario7:scenario7_6049A620_5052_4268_8C22_08451E9EBD2D
