msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Still, you need to be careful.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫You can’t spend too much time in "
"the sun."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫In ogni caso, vedi di stare attenta.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Non puoi passare troppo "
"tempo sotto al sole."

