msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫I had two older brothers."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Avevo due fratelli maggiori."

#: scenario7:scenario7_F6FD7D33_A16B_4BEE_9AA7_52A0128B576F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 40cb825deec724697f13cf3c5e7a77a670a1b6ec36e8f4b4a9eff8f3482ad38a
#. default-sha256: 957b52fa283df28381e90af26ce68945cfe8abc4ea4b616cf9d0135576810e78
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_F6FD7D33_A16B_4BEE_9AA7_52A0128B576F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The eldest, Didier, belonged to an order of knights that served the Church."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Il più grande, Didier, faceva parte di un ordine di cavalieri che serviva la Chiesa."

#: scenario7:scenario7_5CE21799_E4B2_4AA3_AFB1_271B4FB2579C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: abe243ff34bb3cc3f53c2540fcc388b23ac51d60b070fcad07c33eac9339da5b
#. default-sha256: a2e0dca99a6d9dcc3176319ebad74382d187a70587a2bef1a70d476c56b454cc
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_5CE21799_E4B2_4AA3_AFB1_271B4FB2579C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And below him was Georges, who served as a court artist."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E il secondo, Georges, lavorava come artista di corte."

#: scenario7:scenario7_C2FAD12A_1A86_4F8D_9661_1A24D8113827
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 99d55f846ab5ec0b07b830d2b3cd668e9d29d08d168b00ae3677b24a77b1cf61
#. default-sha256: efb59014dcddfa53fc2056165ac83c4cbe2d40efe145a2035b613684b44d1c74
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_C2FAD12A_1A86_4F8D_9661_1A24D8113827"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He was, in all likelihood, who would inherit the family estate,⟪k:1⟫as knights were not "
"formally allowed to own property."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Era lui che, con ogni probabilità, avrebbe ereditato la tenuta della famiglia, in quanto i "
"cavalieri non erano ufficialmente autorizzati⟪k:1⟫a possedere una proprietà."

#: scenario7:scenario7_7B2E246B_09D9_4CC7_BC27_FC94313AEFE1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a83cc2efa1f8aafea5c8a7644ae265a202e8600f9c44ca76e571e39ffe978585
#. default-sha256: d26cd311b798f037d48d922345044b3acf3184bc1f68ec902d9a04cbe5b1827e
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_7B2E246B_09D9_4CC7_BC27_FC94313AEFE1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Nevertheless, the Bollinger family name was upheld by Didier."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Nonostante questo, era Didier a tenere alto il nome della famiglia Bollinger."

#: scenario7:scenario7_AD1B4A28_CEB0_442E_8EF3_BFF5A855B1B6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aeeb6c56f8b4bfd4df36f528f7a187616c1e4d6ec4b8391da990860feb58a023
#. default-sha256: aa3856da1e068525a517930ff2a672098b58b8b5a9b32648304ff3f9825a7edf
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_AD1B4A28_CEB0_442E_8EF3_BFF5A855B1B6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And then there was me, the youngest—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫the only daughter."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E poi c’ero io, la più giovane—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫l’unica figlia."

#: scenario7:scenario7_6C9D1053_1A98_4762_893E_69AFE856DEBF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 678079d16cec7b68b212c39fc0765f5aadf365923204ded89c1ca7fc1550f9f4
#. default-sha256: 21dfbeabed76114257d095564a24a2c01d8d5cf6d172546e578a38e65f9a2eae
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_6C9D1053_1A98_4762_893E_69AFE856DEBF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Physically, I was not in particularly good health.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Because of the color of my skin, "
"I was hypersensitive to sunlight."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Fisicamente, non ero particolarmente in salute.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Per via del colore della mia pelle, "
"ero ipersensibile alla luce del sole."

#: scenario7:scenario7_4380A140_94F1_4C41_8683_C53498013BFA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 990b2d8e564a0a79394a3e250ed4724484212a9ab943527439962896139428bc
#. default-sha256: f3caf7e1e4614935af89bd5635d73738941d2b44a506da540c646005a6154696
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_4380A140_94F1_4C41_8683_C53498013BFA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I rarely left the estate. ⟪k:1⟫My world was contained entirely within these walls."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Raramente uscivo di casa.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Il mio mondo era confinato interamente in quelle mura."

#: scenario7:scenario7_2044A04C_BCA6_41A9_8A50_912DB7080785
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d325ea9c319af70ab2648eef0136d244c68f0f5e4323d9ef785c8950b9f1f2cc
#. default-sha256: cbde49d09d7cd38851fe1f20e1fb9cdefedac640a9d7e3ee6af5e716fc1695da
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_2044A04C_BCA6_41A9_8A50_912DB7080785"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And perhaps out of some sense of pity or compassion,⟪k:1⟫my two brothers spent a good deal "
"of time with me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E mossi forse da un senso di pietà e compassione, i miei due fratelli trascorrevano molto "
"tempo insieme a me."

#: scenario7:scenario7_A2D05211_ACC3_49DB_89DB_EEDF7A9D8979
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 356269471e00ff7fa70b75f0b58cabfe3861f796248f2a803537bd321c327eac
#. default-sha256: 24ff4dd6a7e6d46a5f6fe5042d7534d97eb72157e4e06e80f13e21c2adfa42e3
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_A2D05211_ACC3_49DB_89DB_EEDF7A9D8979"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Didier played chess with me, and Georges taught me how to draw."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Didier giocava con me a scacchi, e Georges mi insegnava a disegnare."

#: scenario7:scenario7_638139D8_135C_4AAA_86B3_F046485B7999
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f8fcba378e0dc1f8ebd569e0bcb725481269d1b6b3a63e8991093bce0a831817
#. default-sha256: 3e8aa3ea7b712525c32141cbbf3998f2467d6ac711c5ea1e4fbc05454754d13d
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_638139D8_135C_4AAA_86B3_F046485B7999"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And among other things, they taught me how to read and write.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫For a girl, I was "
"incredibly fortunate."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E tra le altre cose, mi insegnavano a leggere e a scrivere.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Per essere una ragazza, "
"ero incredibilmente fortunata."

#: scenario7:scenario7_211612B5_6D74_41B6_B14A_6FEC23EE533C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0115a6632496f7936e1195002b530a790d9cb0d4c859b804a8f4e7b51ec3ee64
#. default-sha256: 3391b3a60974f651e99bbb97a93b57c6618d5e94ccff97cca8b2baf0528f885b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_211612B5_6D74_41B6_B14A_6FEC23EE533C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The one thing I wasn’t allowed to do, though, was hold a sword."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫L’unica cosa che non mi era permesso fare, tuttavia, era brandire una spada."

#: scenario7:scenario7_22C434B2_4CF3_4B38_B305_E352B14E7470
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 689fd7e5a8cffe4c52918833d273ce1b6d7d3d660c104a5353487e3175da2511
#. default-sha256: 5ffbdb06f9ab66a16ac1c401b2f0fe3312faea3261066015358f8b6ca80dd509
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_22C434B2_4CF3_4B38_B305_E352B14E7470"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫While hardly anything unusual, it bothered me deeply."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Sebbene non ci fosse nulla di strano, ciò mi infastidiva profondamente."

#: scenario7:scenario7_9DA2CE17_6D52_4AD7_8BE6_7554BB814987
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8fda194447e4e30bdb39932cfe2eeba045ef3317028be72040094359852bf719
#. default-sha256: 0b2380a487df7ff641ac5786a499415998d01eff644cb008e78a775425c50def
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9DA2CE17_6D52_4AD7_8BE6_7554BB814987"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And it had for as long as I could remember."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ed era sempre stato così, da quel che riesco a ricordare."

#: scenario7:scenario7_DFBBA795_374C_4B95_A3D4_D000C829AE2C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2d7432b25865c242d4282c8315c903d76f04f448ce0c2b9e26886bde495d7dcd
#. default-sha256: 3ec37c102d7f1246c63b308a794f5b2b2baf0532b385ed3fee63b030944f20ee
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_DFBBA795_374C_4B95_A3D4_D000C829AE2C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If I had been told I couldn’t do it because I lacked the strength,⟪k:1⟫I probably would have "
"accepted it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Se mi avessero detto che non potevo farlo perché mi mancava la forza,⟪k:1⟫probabilmente "
"l’avrei accettato."

#: scenario7:scenario7_7C983434_7E1C_4DA1_979E_74604548F401
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e0427852dcfabbbfe7227cccfc2128b33f5f890697deec2243d7a9e7a0b27991
#. default-sha256: 8a535d557fb605bbbea7e63fc6a54392f48944c2064a0ee6b54fa4603a88a452
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_7C983434_7E1C_4DA1_979E_74604548F401"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But the reason given was not that I was weak—⟪k:1⟫but that I was a girl."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ma il motivo non era perché ero debole—⟪k:1⟫ma perché ero una ragazza."

#: scenario7:scenario7_600D3ABE_49B0_4D6B_9593_986056A7D486
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eea713a811bc229f444aa62d50defe4197b5ae87667efdc8a9534339b5d6d267
#. default-sha256: a607df7a3666d5b5d87dd64adeacc19f28ea3a26d4b33b113219072f658661d5
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_600D3ABE_49B0_4D6B_9593_986056A7D486"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And with each passing year, that smoldering frustration in the back of my heart grew larger."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E col passare degli anni, quella frustrazione che mi ribolliva nel cuore andava crescendo."

#: scenario7:scenario7_C747822F_1142_48E1_AEFF_7713B30EF201
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aff8251934df504445688f55c011532fc6090296a8a3b88f345856c2209b0ac4
