msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_36EE3520_274C_40E3_AACF_BBDDB32D87FF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫L— ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫L-⟪k:3⟫Like I said, all I want is to put on a good show!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Co— ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫C-⟪k:3⟫Come ho detto, voglio soltanto poter mettere su un bello spettacolo!"

#: scenario7:scenario7_B43EE665_7015_405D_8D78_69614B80EB12
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e59568b651980d1ac251f28f99b63ede0766598e826a74d26d422b90d4803f71
#. default-sha256: 8fb90cd000fb75425324495763e2c17bbbd92c5b0c702b438aa9ffe096666404
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_B43EE665_7015_405D_8D78_69614B80EB12"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Oh, you’ll put on ⟪k:1⟫quite⟪k:2⟫ a show!⟪k:3⟫Unless you learn how to swing that sword "
"properly!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Oh, ma metterai su ⟪k:1⟫proprio⟪k:2⟫ un bello spettacolo!⟪k:3⟫A meno che impari ad oscillare "
"quella spada come si deve!"

#: scenario7:scenario7_2EB98549_78DA_4A36_9732_BCA8DA8713D2
