#. default-sha256: 2f617dd7aebf5ab21813720b40add7e8dfb3c2ba075267d13ca88a451478be61
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_3B2189D6_0FF1_4071_8148_E8C36D0D64A9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Her gentle voice. The sweet scent of her perfume.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The way she constantly told me "
"how much she loved me,⟪k:3⟫and her diatribes about how wonderful it was to be a girl."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La sua voce gentile. Il suo dolce profumo.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Il modo in cui mi diceva costantemente "
"quanto mi amasse,⟪k:3⟫e i suoi discorsi su quanto fosse meraviglioso essere una donna."

#: scenario7:scenario7_3F59DDA7_CF9A_4DF9_BE02_B92DA1FF2467
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7a251869595cabd01ff1919722d40988b07ae27bf4cde767a9e69d33bc534160
#. default-sha256: c7e670c58131201a0a6c792c1c2f8645f3ddbbc48168045b9e44663e3202fca6
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_3F59DDA7_CF9A_4DF9_BE02_B92DA1FF2467"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Everything she did put so much pressure on me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ogni cosa che faceva mi metteva così tanta pressione."

#: scenario7:scenario7_CE2E1D09_66F6_435B_A47D_178C1499ECE6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 77da647d4eb8a33bb6d5b02c2e626c0e5b92998b8aac165cf2c51fda0e1aa840
#. default-sha256: f2a3cad319e81e80109f688325b37ee59591c1f87b5e868300b875b2cd804a3c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_CE2E1D09_66F6_435B_A47D_178C1499ECE6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But above all, she loved to say,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ma soprattutto, amava dirmi,"

#: scenario7:scenario7_40CC3113_166E_4F46_AB19_9B65026E3104
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 915208b2fc2d056a02e191c3d6dbdcadd9558fc0da218de9f0ede6196fa51c6b
#. default-sha256: a33c2c409f5a93165ce2705da8dfa203901c312c230410d1f7535726b9a76d96
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_40CC3113_166E_4F46_AB19_9B65026E3104"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫“You are my little girl, after all.”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫“Sei la mia bambina”."

#: scenario7:scenario7_97EE9F1F_BDCD_4642_A558_613823B6A2B1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 269c43ab8b316976ed1e9500c102143dff93e66a4ae4e03cba2416c4f449ebbf
#. default-sha256: d388add1ec230afd43a321fb6e2ae914b7a59128a701b92e243d5f0a54fbb318
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_97EE9F1F_BDCD_4642_A558_613823B6A2B1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And there was nothing strange about that at all.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Every time I looked in the mirror, "
"I saw the daughter of a noble."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E non c’era niente di strano in questo.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ogni volta che mi guardavo allo specchio, "
"vedevo la figlia di un nobile."

#: scenario7:scenario7_17CA319E_29B8_4BAC_9174_34D54AC6B73E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7711c89eb2b01fd977e8b83503910772d386a709da7cd1729eef0d3271bcae37
#. default-sha256: 47b8268846875e35a95ebbf5608e2e8828a6d551c3223ba3d934f7295acde78f
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_17CA319E_29B8_4BAC_9174_34D54AC6B73E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That was who I was."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ed è ciò che ero."

#: scenario7:scenario7_31BB60FB_F04C_4B7A_B20C_B8B6D53E67B4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 647ab64df3bcac2ef2e62db5ab827393eea53777a37ace85bf5f69afec6368e2
#. default-sha256: 80da616ad2c2054aef4479af6a340ec68ee0180edbae61455e49bc48e0a26a4b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_31BB60FB_F04C_4B7A_B20C_B8B6D53E67B4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫So the only thing wrong was how I felt.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫But every time I was faced with the reality "
"of who I was,⟪k:3⟫my heart wavered."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫L’unica cosa sbagliata, dunque, era come mi sentivo.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ogni volta che mi ritrovavo di "
"fronte alla realtà di chi ero,⟪k:3⟫il mio cuore esitava."

#: scenario7:scenario7_7D390B35_CFEA_44BA_B2D3_9C4936A62744
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 915336ecc822732e3a1b2d20b69a854c36262692c36c931c3fde61f15c874b53
#. default-sha256: 92cf8c753072018932f3ce0fd2073b108697cd7e6d2c7e07d03278cc53043525
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_7D390B35_CFEA_44BA_B2D3_9C4936A62744"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I had no interest in learning to embroider.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I didn’t understand why that was "
"necessary."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non avevo alcun interesse ad imparare a ricamare.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Non capivo perché fosse "
"necessario."

#: scenario7:scenario7_4823A1AD_DAD4_4DB1_ACDD_B3E5A7978C42
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fde7e025e9e7b4e3844b15f9cd67ac4bfab05c9bc6d6db6bd8107899c48f3f09
#. default-sha256: 4292c8f3ab73df93e0e385ae80a96e1964d9ae2e243b4f45d93b2b7c762a11e1
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_4823A1AD_DAD4_4DB1_ACDD_B3E5A7978C42"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I knew what ⟪k:1⟫purpose⟪k:2⟫ it served.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Everything she taught me I would need when "
"I was wed off to some noble boy, and it was my responsibility to learn those things."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sapevo a quale ⟪k:1⟫scopo⟪k:2⟫ servisse.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Tutto ciò che lei mi insegnava mi sarebbe "
"servito per quando mi avrebbero data in sposa a qualche ragazzo nobile, ed era mia responsabilità "
"imparare quelle cose."

#: scenario7:scenario7_DD428462_CCB8_4425_9B29_625B4551C86B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: db07e3ef03cd0b1baf04d3c8ae9e02c77cb98317d30dc115d32bac6db396d1b8
#. default-sha256: a4b29062d515e9ec83cae03b9fa67a4cd4fa4f792e8aa51e5e8b20a99de75dc1
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_DD428462_CCB8_4425_9B29_625B4551C86B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It didn’t ⟪k:1⟫feel⟪k:2⟫ right, though."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ma sentivo che c’era qualcosa che non andava."

#: scenario7:scenario7_DC99167B_038C_4D39_A0E4_1DCA328ED343
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 10de07fb8ca3c30eb13d7d8b1fb5cf1cf657bec459f0142c762f582f736097a4
#. default-sha256: d9bae937df9a494c308867feec396c30ef7958813d8e12447d3cff2350b1362f
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_DC99167B_038C_4D39_A0E4_1DCA328ED343"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I couldn’t even accept the fact that, one day, I ⟪k:1⟫would⟪k:2⟫ be married.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫It was "
"but an ominous shadow lurking in my future."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non riuscivo nemmeno ad accettare il fatto che, un giorno, mi sarei sposata.⟪k:1⟫ Non era "
"altro che un’ombra minacciosa in agguato nel mio futuro."

#: scenario7:scenario7_4C590195_04A2_4FD1_A13E_98ACBEFC6E5B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e052f1caa531d4d05900575d1f50c8df87e70ff9b6a7f82d634e473f41afa7b0
#. default-sha256: 2799fadc58363035d27c02490e1b082ddc443668870d6c529b638bf1d795c99d
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_4C590195_04A2_4FD1_A13E_98ACBEFC6E5B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I would have preferred ravaging the books in Didier’s room than having a conversation with "
"my mother."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Avrei preferito saccheggiare la stanza di Didier di tutti i suoi libri piuttosto che avere "
"una conversazione con mia madre."

#: scenario7:scenario7_B2AFDD9C_5C06_4F2B_ABD1_9D6682D27DF9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1b46ffafc58e0f3baa774ea486f80988769051f21c96360b0de763594c0c7473
#. default-sha256: 22d71c692ff347d99c09955fc683dd3ec322edd4b8d6549fd1f255f5608812d2
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_B2AFDD9C_5C06_4F2B_ABD1_9D6682D27DF9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tales of heroes of old and dauntless soldiers. ⟪k:1⟫Military texts written by tacticians in "
"the midst of war."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Storie di impavidi soldati ed eroi del passato.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Testi militari scritti dai tattici "
"nel bel mezzo della guerra."

#: scenario7:scenario7_02D63A4D_36B0_451F_BA0D_A97A383C2A42
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f9b816c96dd480fa3573bb32e40332e92944568ee233143169755105cb4a90c1
#. default-sha256: 787ebf58638e0e0378860794001f1c8dd1210669e4ca42e8f082107f8d2a41f2
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_02D63A4D_36B0_451F_BA0D_A97A383C2A42"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Thinking about them set my heart aflutter—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫and made me think about my brother. ⟪k:3⟫"
"He was training to be a knight."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Pensare a quei racconti mi faceva battere il cuore—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫e mi faceva pensare a mio "
"fratello. ⟪k:3⟫Si stava allenando per diventare un cavaliere."

#: scenario7:scenario7_FB9D7E3E_A529_401F_AD7D_FB5D1B459759
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2a46ec3f11c5d5fe12124d00bdbdcceb5449ac2759a35c9114efe6f92b26b64a
#. default-sha256: 9bb3bbe59c92cc31555064833c1bf8bc551bad7791db4633e773ada756b33d08
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_FB9D7E3E_A529_401F_AD7D_FB5D1B459759"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I envisioned armor flecked with rust.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫A longsword glimmering with the blood of "
"savages."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Immaginavo un’armatura ricoperta di ruggine.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Una scintillante spada a due mani, "
"macchiata col sangue dei selvaggi."

#: scenario7:scenario7_9CEA3EE3_8726_48B8_852E_D58FAF6208A4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a4c9099befab95981cb7abbccc72a531b8aab99faedb7c24640fcaecb7ae680a
#. default-sha256: e5c84f271544a4dcb657153f5b92e80c6b877b2d4f44da50da404da7126347bb
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9CEA3EE3_8726_48B8_852E_D58FAF6208A4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Soon, I found myself in my fantasies,⟪k:1⟫imagining how the sword would feel in my hands."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Presto, mi ritrovai persa nelle mie fantasie,⟪k:1⟫immaginando cosa avrei provato tenendola "
"fra le mani."

#: scenario7:scenario7_4D6C3525_8C8E_4717_9B51_FB0174D081E3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 69986536246f221e920df71c4c9cd3e0f7227bd13255d08204f46bc56a9cd7c6
#. default-sha256: f79b3adea080a531fc94524372d2c522bff7768298f9909ec3996c3c2053ac49
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_4D6C3525_8C8E_4717_9B51_FB0174D081E3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The sensation of the hilt beneath my fingers.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Swinging it gallantly—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫like "
"my brother."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La sensazione dell’elsa sotto le mie dita.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Agitandola valorosamente—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫come "
"mio fratello."

#: scenario7:scenario7_1ECAFF1A_C8D6_47F4_8762_4CB80EC38154
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e2f256b243cfb3cd687308d1edf20d37469f7cf110f6b3bcc5030b3943b86f54
#. default-sha256: a8e191a482205446ee18806ac33f1efe1d04b1e9a4e2c766a2ee56d814e798f4
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_1ECAFF1A_C8D6_47F4_8762_4CB80EC38154"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫How heavy was it?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫How much muscle would I need to carry it?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫How much "
"impact would I feel in my hands when I struck something?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Quanto era pesante?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Quanti muscoli avrei dovuto avere per trasportarla?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"Quanto sarebbe stato forte l’impatto del colpo nelle mie mani?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_BB693CB4_54E7_4048_868C_F6CFB4159481
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 688a8e6afecb3a865fa201c307f3bcd4e7d108f46306dc24e40760f2dec2915f
#. default-sha256: 2064e82a7842a481820ddacf101f98231de885101f66834e36b49cb37208a84b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_BB693CB4_54E7_4048_868C_F6CFB4159481"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫How restricted would my vision be wearing a helmet?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫How much did it weigh? How hot "
"was it inside?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Quanto si sarebbe ristretta la mia vista indossando un elmetto?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Quanto pesava? "
"Quanto caldo faceva al suo interno?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_E13C4293_797F_4238_B34F_42B0A92CD7C4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7beda802b48e9ea901d2695067d01aecf44a6277406edb2baf2c45281ea21f6f
#. default-sha256: 48df9dfb835c5f37d6a1f3dfa0f54108bb1921e5b78f905afb7ed8a063962e16
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_E13C4293_797F_4238_B34F_42B0A92CD7C4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I had no way of answering any of those questions, though."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Tuttavia, non avevo modo di rispondere a nessuna di quelle domande."

#: scenario7:scenario7_B0B34BF7_29DB_4732_A1D4_B469AC995BC5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dc8f55e9a8b3d3152b431e7f0a636e80a9e658ba7615060b721758214e80b75b
#. default-sha256: 4c7a695e22f50bd92e9bef4514c8b22512c321c2b723e742bc92b0da104cf8f8
